---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import profileImage from '../assets/ivan-tsukev.jpg';
---

<Layout title="За мен | Иван Цукев" description="Научи повече за Иван Цукев - предприемач и създател на Aula.bg.">
  <article class="prose mx-auto">
    <header class="mb-10 opacity-0 animate-fade-in-up">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-6 mb-6 not-prose">
        <!-- Profile photo with decorative elements -->
        <div class="relative flex-shrink-0 group">
          <div class="absolute -top-2 -left-2 w-4 h-4 border-t-2 border-l-2 border-accent/60"></div>
          <div class="absolute -bottom-2 -right-2 w-4 h-4 border-b-2 border-r-2 border-accent-secondary/60"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-2 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent/20 to-accent-secondary/20 rounded-lg blur-xl opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity"></div>
          <Image
            src={profileImage}
            alt="Иван Цукев"
            class="relative w-24 h-24 md:w-28 md:h-28 object-cover rounded-lg border border-border/50 shadow-lg"
            width={112}
            height={112}
          />
        </div>
        <div class="pt-2">
          <span class="section-label">За мен</span>
          <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold">Иван Цукев</h1>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="opacity-0 animate-fade-in-up stagger-2">
      <p class="text-lg">
        Здравей и се радвам, че дойде в моя личен блог 🙂
      </p>

      <p>
        Това е моето място в Интернет, където „свързвам точките" и публикувам всичко, което ми е направило впечатление и не попада в другите ми специализирани блогове.
      </p>

      <p>
        Профилите трудно могат да ме опишат, но за да си спестя малко писане, ще дам насоки за някои от тях: <a href="/infj-mayers-briggs/">INFJ</a>, зодия рак.
      </p>

      <h2>Проекти</h2>

      <p>
        Имам различни интереси, което доведе до създаването на различни проекти. Най-вероятно си тук, за да разбереш повече за мен или за тях. Ето накратко информация за някои от публичните ми проекти:
      </p>

      <p>
        Когато бях ученик, със съученик създадохме <strong>mail.bg</strong> през далечната 1998 г.
      </p>

      <p>
        Преди това бях създал доста по-успешен <strong>афилиейт бизнес</strong> в Щатите, който в последствие затворих, за да се фокусирам върху проектите, към които изпитвам повече влечение.
      </p>

      <p>
        Образованието ми като инженер-конструктор ме отведе да създам <strong>проектантско бюро</strong>.
      </p>

      <p>
        Страстта ми към автоматизацията и създаването на системи ме повлече към създаването на <strong>CAD блог</strong>, който е най-популярният блог в този бранш.
      </p>

      <p>
        Необходимостта да помагам на другите създаде платформата <strong><a href="https://aula.bg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">aula.bg</a></strong>, където провеждам обучения на нещата, които съм научил с много усилия и време, докато се борих самостоятелно.
      </p>
    </div>

    <section class="mt-16 opacity-0 animate-fade-in-up stagger-3">
      <h2>Контакт</h2>

      <p>
        Ако желаеш, можеш да ме последваш в социалните мрежи. Имам и LinkedIn, въпреки че не го ползвам много. Оставил съм Facebook само за семейството, най-близките приятели и хора, които познавам в реалния живот. Можеш да ми пишеш и на <a href="mailto:ivan@ivantsukev.com">ivan@ivantsukev.com</a>.
      </p>

      <!-- Contact cards -->
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-6 not-prose">
        <a
          href="https://x.com/IvanTsukev"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="card-glow p-4 flex items-center gap-3"
        >
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-accent-muted flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-text-primary font-medium font-display">X</div>
            <div class="text-text-muted text-sm">@IvanTsukev</div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://www.instagram.com/ivantsukev/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="card-glow p-4 flex items-center gap-3"
        >
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-accent-muted flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zm0-2.163c-3.259 0-3.667.014-4.947.072-4.358.2-6.78 2.618-6.98 6.98-.059 1.281-.073 1.689-.073 4.948 0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98 1.281.058 1.689.072 4.948.072 3.259 0 3.668-.014 4.948-.072 4.354-.2 6.782-2.618 6.979-6.98.059-1.28.073-1.689.073-4.948 0-3.259-.014-3.667-.072-4.947-.196-4.354-2.617-6.78-6.979-6.98-1.281-.059-1.69-.073-4.949-.073zm0 5.838c-3.403 0-6.162 2.759-6.162 6.162s2.759 6.163 6.162 6.163 6.162-2.759 6.162-6.163c0-3.403-2.759-6.162-6.162-6.162zm0 10.162c-2.209 0-4-1.79-4-4 0-2.209 1.791-4 4-4s4 1.791 4 4c0 2.21-1.791 4-4 4zm6.406-11.845c-.796 0-1.441.645-1.441 1.44s.645 1.44 1.441 1.44c.795 0 1.439-.645 1.439-1.44s-.644-1.44-1.439-1.44z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-text-primary font-medium font-display">Instagram</div>
            <div class="text-text-muted text-sm">@ivantsukev</div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://www.youtube.com/@IvanTsukev"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="card-glow p-4 flex items-center gap-3"
        >
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-accent-muted flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M23.498 6.186a3.016 3.016 0 0 0-2.122-2.136C19.505 3.545 12 3.545 12 3.545s-7.505 0-9.377.505A3.017 3.017 0 0 0 .502 6.186C0 8.07 0 12 0 12s0 3.93.502 5.814a3.016 3.016 0 0 0 2.122 2.136c1.871.505 9.376.505 9.376.505s7.505 0 9.377-.505a3.015 3.015 0 0 0 2.122-2.136C24 15.93 24 12 24 12s0-3.93-.502-5.814zM9.545 15.568V8.432L15.818 12l-6.273 3.568z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-text-primary font-medium font-display">YouTube</div>
            <div class="text-text-muted text-sm">@IvanTsukev</div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://tiktok.com/@ivantsukev"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="card-glow p-4 flex items-center gap-3"
        >
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-accent-muted flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M12.525.02c1.31-.02 2.61-.01 3.91-.02.08 1.53.63 3.09 1.75 4.17 1.12 1.11 2.7 1.62 4.24 1.79v4.03c-1.44-.05-2.89-.35-4.2-.97-.57-.26-1.1-.59-1.62-.93-.01 2.92.01 5.84-.02 8.75-.08 1.4-.54 2.79-1.35 3.94-1.31 1.92-3.58 3.17-5.91 3.21-1.43.08-2.86-.31-4.08-1.03-2.02-1.19-3.44-3.37-3.65-5.71-.02-.5-.03-1-.01-1.49.18-1.9 1.12-3.72 2.58-4.96 1.66-1.44 3.98-2.13 6.15-1.72.02 1.48-.04 2.96-.04 4.44-.99-.32-2.15-.23-3.02.37-.63.41-1.11 1.04-1.36 1.75-.21.51-.15 1.07-.14 1.61.24 1.64 1.82 3.02 3.5 2.87 1.12-.01 2.19-.66 2.77-1.61.19-.33.4-.67.41-1.06.1-1.79.06-3.57.07-5.36.01-4.03-.01-8.05.02-12.07z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-text-primary font-medium font-display">TikTok</div>
            <div class="text-text-muted text-sm">@ivantsukev</div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://www.facebook.com/IvanTsukev"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="card-glow p-4 flex items-center gap-3"
        >
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-accent-muted flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-text-primary font-medium font-display">Facebook</div>
            <div class="text-text-muted text-sm">IvanTsukev</div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://linkedin.com/in/ivantsukev"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="card-glow p-4 flex items-center gap-3"
        >
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-accent-muted flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-text-primary font-medium font-display">LinkedIn</div>
            <div class="text-text-muted text-sm">ivantsukev</div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Email card -->
      <div class="mt-4 not-prose">
        <a
          href="mailto:ivan@ivantsukev.com"
          class="card-glow p-4 flex items-center gap-3"
        >
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-accent-muted flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-text-primary font-medium font-display">Email</div>
            <div class="text-text-muted text-sm">ivan@ivantsukev.com</div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
